    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Piles of legal manuals, stern teachers, and experience in the courtroom have instructed you in legal matters. You're capable of mounting a prosecution or defense in court, and you tend to keep abreast of local laws, as you never know when you might need to know them on short notice.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Legal Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Group Impression skill feat."
    },
